# oracle: fix sgcmc with the variance constraint (VC-SGC: variance 1000 0.2, the second rejection test on the global random stream) and NPT (aniso 0 0 1.5, as examples/mc/in.sgcmc.eam), pair eam/fs VFe_mm.eam.fs, 1024 bcc atoms, an MC event every 10 steps, 40 steps.
# oracle-potentials: VFe_mm.eam.fs
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice bcc 2.855
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.1 12345
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * VFe_mm.eam.fs Fe V
timestep 0.002
velocity all create 1200 4928459 dist gaussian
fix integrate all npt temp 600 600 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.5
fix mc all sgcmc 10 0.2 600 -0.3 randseed 324234 variance 1000 0.2
thermo_style custom step temp pe press f_mc[1] f_mc[2] f_mc[3] f_mc[4]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 10
run 40
